# Power BI Project (PBIP) ignore rules

# Local semantic model cache — regenerated automatically when the model is opened in Power BI Desktop, and can be large. Never needs to be version controlled.
**/.pbi/cache.abf

# Local, machine-specific Desktop settings (paths, window state, last opened tab, etc.) — not meaningful to anyone but the machine that created them.
**/.pbi/localSettings.json

# Local editor backups Power BI Desktop sometimes creates
**/.pbi/backup*

# OS/editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
